/* The practice agent's own words */
"Weekly update · Oct 9" = "周报 · 10月9日";
"Growth." = "增长：";
"1,284 signups this week, up %@ on last week. Activation held at %@, and 23 people churned, 4 fewer than last week." = "本周新增注册 1,284 人，比上周增长 %@。激活率保持在 %@，流失 23 人，比上周少 4 人。";
"Shipped." = "已上线：";
"Six pull requests merged: faster search on large libraries, a fix for the crash when closing a window, one-step permissions in onboarding, dark mode for Settings, retries for failed uploads, and updated dependencies." = "合并了 6 个拉取请求：加快大型资料库的搜索、修复关闭窗口时的崩溃、导览中一步完成权限设置、为设置加入深色模式、失败的上传会自动重试，以及更新依赖项。";
"Wrote this week's update to %@, in two parts: growth, from this week's numbers; and what shipped, the six merged pull requests. Check the numbers before Maya posts it: they're from this morning." = "已将本周周报写入 %@，分为两部分：根据本周数据写的增长情况，以及已上线的内容（合并的 6 个拉取请求）。Maya 发出前请再核对一下数据，这些是今天早上的数字。";
"Added an insulated jacket, warm gloves, microspikes and sunglasses to your packing list, for the fresh snow up top. The report says the light goes by four, so the headlamp you already had stays on it." = "考虑到山顶的新雪，已在打包清单里加上保暖外套、保暖手套、冰爪和太阳镜。报告说下午四点天就暗了，所以清单里原有的头灯继续保留。";
"Sorted the list into Clothes and Gear, each item kept as it was. The jacket, gloves and sunglasses are under Clothes; the tent, stove and microspikes under Gear." = "已把清单分成“衣物”和“装备”两类，每一项都保持原样。外套、手套和太阳镜归入衣物，帐篷、炉头和冰爪归入装备。";
"Claude Code isn't signed in on this Mac, so the practice agent answered. Run claude in Terminal once to sign in." = "这台 Mac 上的 Claude Code 尚未登录，所以由练习 Agent 回答。在“终端”中运行一次 claude 即可登录。";
"Claude Code didn't finish (%@) The practice agent answered instead." = "Claude Code 没有完成（%@），已改由练习 Agent 回答。";
"The practice agent answered this one." = "这次由练习 Agent 回答。";
"The keyboard made it clear what to press, and the tasks felt like real work. The permissions took me a moment." = "键盘把该按什么讲得很清楚，任务也很像真实的工作。权限设置让我花了点时间。";
"Friday at three works for me." = "周五三点我可以。";

